ckets-and-a-blocked-revenue-estimate)525 0 R(executive-summary)520 0 R(slack-integration-vs-reporting-rewrite-quarterly-capacity-decision)519 0 R(trade-off-matrix-collapsed-into-chain-c4-above-full-matrix-shown-here-for-auditability)532 0 R]>>>>>>
